@startuml View Product Categories Sequence Diagram
title UC09 - View Product Categories (Xem danh sách danh mục sản phẩm)

actor "Staff/Manager" as User
participant "Product\nCategories Page" as Frontend
participant "productRoutes" as Routes
participant "authMiddleware" as AuthMW
participant "productController" as Controller
participant "productService" as Service
participant "ProductCategory Model" as Model
database "MongoDB" as DB

== Khởi tạo trang ==
User -> Frontend: 1. Click "Danh mục sản phẩm"\ntrên Sidebar
activate Frontend

Frontend -> Frontend: 2. Mount component\nvà gọi fetchList()

== Lấy danh sách product categories với phân trang ==
Frontend -> Routes: 3. GET /api/product-categories\n?page=1&limit=10\n(Bearer Token)
activate Routes

Routes -> AuthMW: 4. Verify JWT token
activate AuthMW

AuthMW -> AuthMW: 5. Extract user info\nfrom token (canteenId)

opt Token không hợp lệ
    AuthMW --> Routes: 6a. 401 Unauthorized
    Routes --> Frontend: HTTP 401 Response
    Frontend -> Frontend: Redirect to Login
end

AuthMW -> Routes: 6. req.user = decoded\n(userId, canteenId, role)
deactivate AuthMW
    
    Routes -> Controller: 7. getAllProductCategories\n(req, res)
    activate Controller
    
    Controller -> Controller: 8. Extract canteenId\nfrom req.user
    
    Controller -> Service: 9. getAllProductCategories\n(queryParams, canteenId)
    activate Service
    
    Service -> Service: 10. Build options:\n{baseFilter: {canteenId: canteenId}}
    
    Service -> Model: 11. paginatedQuery(Model,\nqueryParams, options)
    activate Model
    
    Model -> DB: 12. find({canteenId: xxx})\n.skip(0).limit(10)\n.sort({createdAt: -1})
    activate DB
    
    DB --> Model: 13. Return categories\n(filtered by canteenId)
    deactivate DB
    
    Model -> DB: 14. countDocuments\n({canteenId: xxx})
    activate DB
    
    DB --> Model: 15. Return total count
    deactivate DB
    
    Model --> Service: 16. Return {\ndata: [...],\npagination: {...}\n}
    deactivate Model
    
    Service --> Controller: 17. Return result object
    deactivate Service
    
    Controller -> Controller: 18. Format response:\n{\nsuccess: true,\nmessage: "Lấy danh sách sản phẩm\nthành công",\ndata: [...],\npagination: {...}\n}
    
    Controller --> Routes: 19. HTTP 200 Response
    deactivate Controller
    
    Routes --> Frontend: 20. JSON Response
    deactivate Routes
    
    Frontend -> Frontend: 21. setState:\n- items = response.data\n- pagination = response.pagination\n- loading = false
    
    Frontend -> Frontend: 22. Render Table\nvới các cột:\n- Tên danh mục\n- Mô tả\n- Trạng thái (Active tag)\n- Ngày tạo\n- Hành động
    
    Frontend --> User: 23. Hiển thị danh sách\nproduct categories\n(có phân trang)

deactivate Frontend

== Chuyển trang ==
User -> Frontend: 24. Click trang 2
activate Frontend

Frontend -> Routes: 25. GET /api/product-categories\n?page=2&limit=10
note right: Lặp lại flow từ bước 4-23

Frontend --> User: 26. Hiển thị dữ liệu trang 2
deactivate Frontend

== Thay đổi page size ==
User -> Frontend: 27. Chọn "20 / page"
activate Frontend

Frontend -> Routes: 28. GET /api/product-categories\n?page=1&limit=20
note right: Lặp lại flow từ bước 4-23

Frontend --> User: 29. Hiển thị 20 items/page
deactivate Frontend

@enduml
